Open an empty file and enter "hello, world!" into it via the virtual filesystem
interface by appending directly to the file body.

-- config --
path: tests/data/config/with-fsys.toml
-- file-hello.txt --
-- actions --
fsys: write buffers/1/body hello, world!
-- buffer-list --
1    * hello.txt
-- expected-windows --
1
-- expected-buffer-1 --
hello, world!

